# The devcontainer bind-mounts this tree wholesale into Linux:
#
#   volumes:
#     - ../..:/workspaces/goiabada
#
# so whatever the checkout puts on disk is what go, gofmt and the shell scripts inside the
# container read. Under core.autocrlf that is CRLF, and CRLF reaches a Linux toolchain as
# part of the line: a shell script fails on `\r`, and a golden file never matches.
#
# LF everywhere, decided here rather than left to each machine's git config, so the working
# tree is the same bytes on every checkout of this repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The setup wizard's goldens are its generators' output byte for byte, and the hostile env file
# carries a carriage return inside a quoted value on purpose, which normalising would strip. The
# generators write LF, so storing these unconverted keeps them LF too (#430).
src/cmd/goiabada-setup/testdata/*.golden -text
